  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk-0341",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "第五部分：论述题（材料分析题）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0342",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "答题技巧：先抄材料关键词，再结合自己的生活经验写感想。千万不要留空白",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0343",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "论述题1",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0344",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0345",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你在网上看到一个很漂亮的蓝牙音箱，商品页面展示了三张图：一张是正面图，一张是侧面图，还有一张是音箱放在书桌上、旁边有本书和一杯咖啡的场景图。三张图看起来都很真实，光影自然，音箱的金属网罩有细腻的质感，木纹底座也很逼真。你收到实物后发现，音箱确实和图片上差不多，但图片上的光影效果比实物更好看。你好奇这些图是怎么做出来的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0346",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：请说说这些商品展示图可能是怎么做出来的？它们和普通拍照有什么不同？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0347",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0348",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "这些图很可能是用建模软件建好模型，再用渲染软件渲染出来的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0349",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "普通拍照是拍真实的产品，渲染图是用电脑做出来的虚拟效果。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0350",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "渲染图可以控制灯光、角度、背景，比拍照更自由。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0351",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "渲染图可以把产品放在任何场景里，比如书桌上、草地上。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0352",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "渲染图可以做得比实物更好看，突出产品的优点。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0353",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "渲染图是设计师用来展示设计方案的，不是真实拍的照片。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0354",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你要给自己设计的一个小产品（比如手机支架、笔筒、小夜灯）做一张展示图，你会怎么准备？请说出至少两条。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0355",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0356",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "先想好产品放在什么场景里，比如书桌上、床头柜上。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0357",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "想好从哪个角度拍最好看，正面、侧面还是俯视。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0358",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "想好灯光从哪边打过来，让产品有立体感。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0359",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "想好背景是什么颜色，和产品搭配。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0360",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "想好要突出产品的哪个特点，比如造型、材质、功能。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0361",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "论述题2",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0362",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0363",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你买了一个新的鼠标，用了一段时间后发现，鼠标的曲面很贴合手掌，握起来很舒服。你仔细观察了一下，鼠标的顶部有一条平缓的弧线，从指尖一直延伸到手掌根部。鼠标的侧面有微微的凹陷，刚好让拇指和无名指放进去。鼠标的表面是磨砂材质，手上有汗也不滑。你想起以前用过的鼠标是扁平的，握久了手酸。你开始好奇，设计师是怎么做出这种贴合手掌的曲面的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0364",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：请说说这个鼠标的曲面为什么握起来舒服？它可能考虑了什么因素？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0365",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0366",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "鼠标顶部的弧线贴合手掌的自然弯曲，手不用使劲。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0367",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "侧面的凹陷让手指有地方放，不会悬空。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0368",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "磨砂材质增加摩擦力，手上有汗也不滑。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0369",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "鼠标的尺寸和手掌大小匹配，不会太大或太小。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0370",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "鼠标的造型是设计师根据人手的数据反复调整出来的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0371",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "好的鼠标曲面是“贴合人手”的，不是随便画出来的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0372",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你要给自己设计一个“握起来舒服”的产品（比如水杯、手柄、剪刀），你会怎么考虑它的形状？请说出至少两条。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0373",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0374",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "先看手是怎么握的，手指放在哪里最自然。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0375",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "形状要贴合手的曲线，不要有硌手的地方。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0376",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "表面要防滑，手上有水或者有汗也不滑。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0377",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "重量要适中，拿久了不累。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0378",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "尺寸要适合目标用户，比如给小孩用的要小一点。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0379",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "论述题3",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0380",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0381",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你在网上看到一个电水壶，商品详情页写着“无缝内胆，一体成型”。你收到实物后发现，水壶里面确实很光滑，没有接缝，清洗很方便。你想起以前用的水壶，内胆有接缝，接缝处容易积水垢，很难刷干净。你好奇这个“无缝内胆”是怎么做出来的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0382",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：请说说“无缝内胆”可能对使用体验有什么好处？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0383",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0384",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "没有接缝，不容易积水垢，更卫生。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0385",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "清洗方便，抹布一擦就干净。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0386",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "没有接缝，看起来更精致、更高级。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0387",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "没有接缝，不会因为接缝处老化而漏水。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0388",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "无缝内胆说明设计师在建模时曲面连续性好，没有破面。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0389",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "无缝设计让用户用起来更放心，不用担心藏污纳垢。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0390",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你要设计一个“好清洗”的水杯，你会从哪些方面考虑？请说出至少两条。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0391",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0392",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "杯口要大，手能伸进去洗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0393",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "内壁要光滑，不要有接缝和死角。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0394",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "杯盖要能拆开洗，密封圈也要能拆下来。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0395",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "材质要不粘污渍，比如玻璃或者不锈钢。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0396",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "底部不要有复杂的造型，平平的就好洗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0397",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "论述题4",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0398",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0399",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你在商店看到一个台灯，灯臂是软管的，可以任意弯曲调整角度。你试着弯了几下，发现灯臂很灵活，但不会自己掉下来。你仔细看了一下，灯臂外面是硅胶，里面是金属丝。底座很重，放在桌上很稳。你想起以前用的台灯，灯臂是硬的，角度调不了，用起来很不方便。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0400",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：请说说这个台灯的“可弯曲灯臂”和“重底座”分别解决了什么问题？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0401",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0402",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "可弯曲灯臂可以调整照射角度，看书、写字、用电脑都能调。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0403",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "可弯曲灯臂可以调整高度，适合不同身高的人。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0404",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "重底座让台灯稳稳地站在桌上，不会被灯臂带倒。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0405",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "重底座让台灯可以放在桌边，不会因为碰到就掉下去。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0406",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "硅胶外皮让灯臂摸起来舒服，不会冰手。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0407",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "金属丝内芯让灯臂可以反复弯曲，不会断。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0408",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你要设计一个“用起来方便”的台灯，你会从哪些方面考虑？请说出至少两条。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0409",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0410",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "亮度可以调节，看书写字用亮一点，玩手机用暗一点。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0411",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "灯臂可以弯曲或者调节角度，方便调整照射方向。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0412",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "底座要稳，不会被碰倒。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0413",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "开关要方便，最好能触控或者遥控。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0414",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "灯光不刺眼，看久了眼睛不累。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0415",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "外观要好看，放在桌上不丑。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0416",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "论述题5",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0417",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0418",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你买了一个新的键盘，用了一段时间后发现，打字久了手指不疼了。你仔细观察了一下，键盘的按键有微微的弧度，手指放上去很贴合。按键的间距比以前的键盘大一点，不容易按错。键盘还有一个手托，手腕放在上面很舒服。你想起以前用的键盘，按键是平的，打字久了手指疼、手腕酸。你开始好奇，键盘的按键为什么要做成有弧度的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0419",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：请说说这个键盘的按键弧度和手托分别解决了什么问题？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0420",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0421",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "按键有弧度，贴合手指指腹，打字时手指不用伸平。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0422",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "按键有弧度，手指按下去更省力，不容易累。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0423",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "按键间距大，不容易误触旁边的键，打字更准。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0424",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "手托让手腕有支撑，不用悬空打字。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0425",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "手托让手腕保持自然姿势，减少酸痛。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0426",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "好的键盘设计是让手指和手腕都舒服。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0427",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你要给自己选一个“打字舒服”的键盘，你会看哪些方面？请说出至少两条。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0428",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0429",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "按键有没有弧度，贴合不贴合手指。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0430",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "按键间距大不大，会不会容易按错。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0431",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "有没有手托，手腕有没有支撑。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0432",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "按键力度轻不轻，打字费不费劲。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0433",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "键盘有没有倾斜角度，手腕姿势自然不自然。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0434",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "键盘大小适不适合自己的手。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0435",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "论述题6",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0436",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0437",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你在网上看到一个保温杯，商品详情页写着“杯盖可拆卸，清洗无死角”。你收到实物后发现，杯盖确实可以拆成三个部分：外盖、密封圈、内盖。每个部分都能单独清洗，密封圈也能取下来洗。你想起以前用的保温杯，杯盖是一体的，洗不干净，时间久了里面发霉。你好奇这个“可拆卸杯盖”是怎么设计出来的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0438",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：请说说“可拆卸杯盖”对使用体验有什么好处？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0439",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0440",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "杯盖可以拆开，每个角落都能洗到，更卫生。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0441",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "密封圈可以取下来洗，不容易发霉。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0442",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "可拆卸的杯盖，密封圈坏了可以单独换，不用换整个杯盖。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0443",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "可拆卸的杯盖，零件坏了可以单独换，延长水杯使用寿命。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0444",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "可拆卸设计让用户用起来更放心，不用担心藏污纳垢。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0445",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "可拆卸设计说明设计师考虑了用户的清洗需求。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0446",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你要设计一个“好清洗”的保温杯，你会从哪些方面考虑？请说出至少两条。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0447",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0448",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "杯盖要能拆开，每个零件都能单独洗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0449",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "密封圈要能取下来，方便清洗和更换。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0450",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "杯口要大，手能伸进去洗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0451",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "内壁要光滑，不要有接缝和死角。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0452",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "材质要不粘污渍，比如316不锈钢。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0453",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "杯底不要有复杂的造型，平平的就好洗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0454",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "论述题7",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0455",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0456",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你戴的耳机，戴久了耳朵疼。你仔细观察了一下，耳机的入耳部分比较粗，塞进耳朵后撑得慌。耳机的重量也不轻，戴久了耳朵有下坠感。你换了几个不同大小的耳塞，发现小一号的耳塞舒服一些，但隔音效果差了。你想起以前用过的耳机，入耳部分很细，戴久了也不疼。你好奇耳机的入耳部分为什么要设计成不同大小的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0457",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：请说说耳机入耳部分的大小和重量对佩戴舒适性有什么影响？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0458",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0459",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "入耳部分太粗，撑得耳朵疼。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0460",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "入耳部分太细，隔音效果差，容易掉。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0461",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "耳机太重，戴久了耳朵有下坠感。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0462",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "不同人的耳道大小不一样，需要不同尺寸的耳塞。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0463",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "好的耳机设计会提供多种尺寸的耳塞，让用户选。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0464",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "耳机重量轻，佩戴更舒适。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0465",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你要设计一个“久戴不疼”的耳机，你会从哪些方面考虑？请说出至少两条。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0466",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0467",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "提供多种尺寸的耳塞，适配不同耳道。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0468",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "入耳部分用柔软的硅胶，贴合耳道。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0469",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "减轻耳机重量，用轻量化材料。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0470",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "增加耳翼设计，固定在耳廓上，减少下坠。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0471",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "耳机造型贴合耳廓曲线，不容易掉。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0472",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "线控按钮做大一点，方便盲操作。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0473",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "论述题8",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0474",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请阅读以下材料：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0475",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你去电影院看电影，坐了两个小时，发现腿麻了，脖子也酸。你观察了一下电影院的座椅：座椅的坐深很大，你的后背靠不到椅背，腰部悬空。座椅的高度也让你的脚够不到地，小腿悬在空中。屏幕位置比较高，你要仰着头看。你想起以前在图书馆坐的椅子，有腰托、有扶手，坐久了也不累。你好奇电影院的座椅为什么不设计得舒服一点。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0476",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题一：请说说电影院座椅的坐深、高度和屏幕位置分别对观影体验有什么影响？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0477",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0478",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "坐深太大，后背靠不到椅背，腰部悬空，坐久了腰疼。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0479",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "座椅太高，脚够不到地，小腿悬空，腿麻。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0480",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "屏幕太高，仰头看，颈椎压力大。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0481",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "座椅排列太密，腿伸不开，血液循环不畅。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0482",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "没有腰托，腰部没有支撑，容易累。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0483",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "没有扶手，想起来的时候要用手撑。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0484",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "问题二：如果你来设计电影院的座椅，你会从哪些方面改进？请说出至少两条。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0485",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0486",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "坐深减小，让后背能靠到椅背。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0487",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "座椅高度可调，或者加脚踏，让脚有地方放。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0488",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "加腰托，支撑腰椎。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0489",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "屏幕高度适当降低，减少仰头角度。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0490",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "座椅间距加大，腿部有活动空间。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0491",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "加扶手，方便起身。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
}
